[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0520","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0520.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45780","title":"GNU GRUB2 tar文件解析整数溢出导致堆越界写入漏洞","description":"GNU GRUB2 的 tar 文件系统解析器在处理畸形 tar 文件时存在整数溢出漏洞。当读取 tar 文件时，GRUB2 为文件名分配内部缓冲区，但在分配长度计算过程中未正确校验整数溢出风险。攻击者可通过构造特制的 tar 文件触发分配长度溢出，导致堆越界写入。该漏洞允许具有本地高权限的攻击者绕过 Secure Boot 安全启动保护机制，在系统启动阶段执行任意代码，破坏系统完整性验证链。CVSS 评分 6.7，危害等级中等，影响使用 GRUB2 的多个 Linux 发行版。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.7,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45780"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-03T15:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:41Z","remediation":"升级 GRUB2 至包含 commit 0087bc69 的版本（如 GRUB 2.12 以上或对应发行版补丁包）。对于 Red Hat 系发行版，安装 RHSA 安全更新；Debian/Ubuntu 运行 `apt update && apt upgrade grub-pc` 后执行 `update-grub`。无法立即升级时，启用 UEFI Secure Boot 并配置 shim 签名验证，限制本地攻击者加载自制 tar 归档的物理访问条件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45780","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2345856","https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45780.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45780.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/b14f5555ae5b53d86b7353a1ef112eb3496498f9/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45780.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45780","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/g/grub2/grub2.spec","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45780.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-45780.md","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-xxc4-h4cm-j5r2/GHSA-xxc4-h4cm-j5r2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0520.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0519","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0519.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45779","title":"GNU GRUB2 BFS文件系统解析器整数溢出导致堆越界读取漏洞","description":"GNU GRUB2 的 BFS 文件系统驱动程序中存在整数溢出漏洞。当读取包含间接映射表的文件时，grub2 未能正确验证要读取的 extent 条目数量，导致在处理特制或损坏的 BFS 文件系统时发生整数溢出，进而引发堆越界读取。本地攻击者需要拥有高权限，通过挂载恶意构造的 BFS 文件系统触发该漏洞，可能导致敏感内存信息泄露或 GRUB2 崩溃。该漏洞影响所有使用 grub2 的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 6.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45779"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-03T15:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:41Z","remediation":"升级 grub2 至修复版本（>2.12）。若厂商尚未发布正式更新包，可从 grub-devel 邮件列表（https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html）获取补丁自行编译安装。Red Hat/CentOS 用户关注 RHSA 安全公告，Ubuntu/Debian 用户通过 `apt update && apt upgrade grub-pc grub2-common` 安装更新。由于该漏洞需要本地高权限且无法远程利用，临时缓解措施可限制系统物理访问和本地用户登录权限，仅允许受信任用户执行 grub2 相关操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45779","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2345854","https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45779.nopatch","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45779.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/d5bf3451a732b5296c5b8cc86dbcb9121c5ea07d/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45779.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/g/grub2/grub2.spec","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45779","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45779.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-45779.md","https://github.com/seapath/meta-seapath/blob/479229566d9de44367de66249dba8ed29de7b8ff/recipes-bsp/grub/files/CVE-2024-45778_CVE-2024-45779.patch","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-45779.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0519.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0681","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0681.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58034","title":"Linux Kernel Tegra20 EMC 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 tegra20-emc 驱动中存在一处设备树（OF）节点引用释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。函数 tegra_emc_find_node_by_ram_code() 调用 of_find_node_by_name() 时会释放传入的设备节点引用，但该节点在后续代码中仍被继续使用，导致 UAF 问题。本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞触发内核内存破坏，实现权限提升，导致系统崩溃或完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响使用 NVIDIA Tegra20 平台及 Linux 内核的嵌入式设备和系统，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58034"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T20:16:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:29Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至包含该补丁的版本。Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户升级至 linux-image-5.15.0-140-generic 及以上版本（USN-7510-1）；Ubuntu 22.04 HWE 用户升级至 linux-image-6.8.0-64-generic（USN-7653-1）；Debian 11 用户安装 DLA-4102 提供的更新内核。其他发行版请更新至主线内核 6.14-rc2 及以上版本，该补丁已合入上游。更新后须重启系统生效。如无法立即更新，可限制本地用户对 Tegra20 设备的访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3b02273446e23961d910b50cc12528faec649fb2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/755e44538c190c31de9090d8e8821d228fcfd416","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b9784e5cde1f9fb83661a70e580e381ae1264d12","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c144423cb07e4e227a8572d5742ca2b36ada770d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c3def10c610ae046aaa61d00528e7bd15e4ad8d3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e9d07e91de140679eeaf275f47ad154467cb9e05","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58034.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58034.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58034.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58034","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58034.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58034.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-58034-2025-11-03-1400","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-58034.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-fhjf-w34g-fcvp/GHSA-fhjf-w34g-fcvp.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-58034"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0681.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0680","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0680.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58020","title":"Linux 内核 HID 多点触控驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 HID 多点触控驱动中的 mt_input_configured 函数在调用 devm_kasprintf() 分配内存时未对返回值进行空指针检查，当内存分配失败时函数返回 NULL，导致内核空指针解引用错误，引发系统崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞需要本地低权限访问，攻击难度低，影响 Linux 内核多个发行版版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58020"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:12Z","updated":"2026-07-14T13:17:15Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：5.4.291、5.10.235、5.15.179、6.1.129、6.6.79、6.12.16 或 6.13.4 及以上。各发行版用户请安装对应安全更新：Ubuntu 安装 USN-7510/7511/7540/7640/7703 系列更新，Debian 安装 DLA-4102/4178 更新。Siemens SIMATIC S7-1500 MFP 用户请参考 SSA-019113/SSA-265688 安装补丁。如无法立即更新，可卸载或禁用相关 HID 多点触控驱动模块（hid-multitouch）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2052b44cd0a62b6fdbe3371e5ba6029c56c400ca","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4e7113f591163d99adc7cbcd7295030c8c5d3fc7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/62f8bf06262b6fc55c58f4c5256140f1382f3b01","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/97c09cc2e72769edb6994b531edcfa313b96bade","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9b8e2220d3a052a690b1d1b23019673e612494c5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a04d96ef67a42165f93194eef22a270acba4b74c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a6bfd3856e9f3da083f177753c623d58ba935e0a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/aa879ef6d3acf96fa2c7122d0632061d4ea58d48","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-019113.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58020.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58020.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac71