10.235-227.919 或更高版本。若无法立即重启升级内核，该漏洞仅影响本地低权限攻击场景且仅可导致拒绝服务，可暂时降低风险优先级处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3d6f83df8ff2d5de84b50377e4f0d45e25311c7a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/404e5fd918a0b14abec06c7eca128f04c9b98e41","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4a2c4e7265b8eed83c25d86d702cea06493cab18","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4acf6bab775dbd22a9a799030a808a7305e01d63","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/54c14022fa2ba427dc543455c2cf9225903a7174","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9a6d43844de2479a3ff8d674c3e2a16172e01598","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bb8ff054e19fe27f4e5eaac1b05e462894cfe9b1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dfb7b179741ee09506dc7719d92f9e1cea01f10e","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58017.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58017.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58017","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-58017.md","https://github.com/HerringLiu2333/Analysis-of-CWE/blob/cd8202c32037ed388ecd79e1fc81394f13c4d4a4/CVE-2024-58017/CVE-2024-58017.ql","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58017.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-58017-2025-11-03-1335","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-58017.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-572c-4f8h-65c4/GHSA-572c-4f8h-65c4.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-58017-printk-fix-signed-integer-overflow--1771406440000.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0679.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0678","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0678.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58015","title":"Linux kernel ath12k WiFi驱动越界访问漏洞","description":"Linux kernel ath12k WiFi 驱动中的 selfgen 统计信息处理函数 `print_array_to_buf_index()` 传入的数组长度参数过大，导致越界内存访问（CWE-125）。本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞读取越界内存中的敏感信息或造成系统崩溃，影响机密性和可用性。该漏洞由 Coverity 扫描发现（CID 1600742/1600758），影响使用 ath12k 驱动的 Linux 内核系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58015"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:28Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.13.3 或更高版本，或合入补丁 commit 8700c4bf8b7ed98037d2acf1eaf770ad6dd431d4（主线）及 eb8c0534713865d190856f10bfc97cf0b88475b1（稳定分支）。对于无法立即升级的系统，可通过禁用受影响硬件上的 ath12k 内核模块（modprobe -r ath12k）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8700c4bf8b7ed98037d2acf1eaf770ad6dd431d4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/eb8c0534713865d190856f10bfc97cf0b88475b1","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58015.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58015.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-58015","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2024-58015.md","https://github.com/HerringLiu2333/Analysis-of-CWE/blob/cd8202c32037ed388ecd79e1fc81394f13c4d4a4/CVE-2024-58015/CVE-2024-58015.ql","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58015.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-58015.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-58015-wifi-ath12k-fix-for-out-of-bound-ac-1771407704000.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-58015.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-wgxf-r68r-7w9h/GHSA-wgxf-r68r-7w9h.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0678.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0677","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0677.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58013","title":"Linux 内核蓝牙 MGMT 模块释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核蓝牙子系统的 MGMT 协议实现中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，位于 `mgmt_remove_adv_monitor_sync` 函数中。当移除广告监控器时，`mgmt_pending` 结构体被释放后仍被访问，导致 slab 内存被释放后再次读取。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞造成系统崩溃或提升权限，获取敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核蓝牙协议栈，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高，攻击者需具备本地低权限访问条件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58013"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:27Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至包含修复补丁（commit 26fbd3494a7d）的版本：主线内核升级至 6.14-rc1 或更高版本，Debian bookworm 升级至 6.1.129-1 或更高版本，Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 升级至 linux-image 6.8.0-64.67 或更高版本，Ubuntu 24.10 升级至 6.11.0-26.26 或更高版本。如暂时无法升级内核，可在蓝牙子系统未使用的设备上通过禁用蓝牙模块（blacklist btusb）来消除攻击面，或通过 CONFIG_BT_MGMT 编译选项关闭蓝牙管理接口以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0f3d05aacbfcf3584bbd9caaee34cb02508dab68","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/26fbd3494a7dd26269cb0817c289267dbcfdec06","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4ebbcb9bc794e5be647ee28fdf14eb1ae0659405","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/75e65b983c5e2ee51962bfada98a79d805f28827","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ebb90f23f0ac21044aacf4c61cc5d7841fe99987","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58013.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58013.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58013","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58013.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58013.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58013.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-58013-2025-11-03-1400","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-58013.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-qg99-hc5r-rhvg/GHSA-qg99-hc5r-rhvg.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-58013"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0677.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0676","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0676.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58012","title":"Linux 内核 ASoC SOF Intel HDA-DAI 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ASoC 子系统中 SOF Intel HDA-DAI 驱动存在空指针解引用漏洞。当音频拓扑（topology）为聚合放大器创建 DAI widget 数量不足时，CPU DAI 无法关联到有效的 widget，在参数处理过程中访问空指针导致内核崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞触发拒绝服务（系统崩溃），影响使用 Intel HDA 音频设备的 Linux 系统。Red Hat 已通过 RHSA-2025:20518 安全公告修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58012"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:27Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.14、6.13.3 或 6.14 及以上版本，其中已包含对 hda-dai 中 DAI widget 空指针解引用的修复。RHEL 9 用户可安装 RHSA-2025:20518 提供的 kernel-5.14.0-611.5.1.el9_7 更新包，安装后重启系统生效。如无法立即升级，可在拓扑配置中避免为聚合放大器使用不匹配的 DAI widget 数量作为临时规避措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/569922b82ca660f8b24e705f6cf674e6b1f99cc7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/789a2fbf0900982788408d3b0034e0e3f914fb3b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e012a77e4d7632cf615ba9625b1600ed8985c3b5","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58012.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58012.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58012.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58012.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58012","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58012.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-58012.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-r4cp-jgm6-j6m3/GHSA-r4cp-jgm6-j6m3.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-58012","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-58012.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0676.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0675","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0675.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58011","title":"Linux Kernel int3472 驱动程序空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 platform/x86 子系统中 int3472 驱动程序存在空指针解引用漏洞。当设备没有 ACPI 伴生 fwnode 时，adev 指针可能为 NULL，而 skl_int3472_get_acpi_buffer() 函数在未对 adev 进行空值检查的情况下直接使用该指针，导致空指针解引用。本地低权限攻击者可通过 sysfs 手动将 int3472 驱动绑定到其他 i2c/platform 设备触发此漏洞，造成内核崩溃，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 Intel 平台/x86 int3472 驱动的 Linux 内核系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58011"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:12Z","updated":"2026-07-14T13:17:15Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下安全版本：5.15.195、6.1.129、6.6.78、6.12.14、6.13.3 或 6.14 及以上版本。Debian 11 用户请运行 `apt update && apt upgrade linux` 应用 DLA-4102-1 安全更新；Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户请运行 `apt update && apt upgrade linux-image-generic` 应用 USN-8163-1 更新。Siemens SIMATIC S7-1500 MFP 用户请参考 Siemens 安全公告 SSA-019113 升级固件。如无法立即升级，可通过限制本地用户对 sysfs 接口的写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0a30353beca2693d30bde477024d755ffecea514","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/46263a0b687a044e645387a9c7692ccd693f09f1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4f8b210823cc2d1f9d967f089a6c00d025bb237f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a808ecf878ad646ebc9c83d9fc4ce72fd9c49d3d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cd2fd6eab480dfc247b737cf7a3d6b009c4d0f1c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f9c7cc44758f4930b41285a6d54afa8cbd9762b4","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-019113.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58011.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58011.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58011","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58011.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-58011.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58011.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-58011-2025-11-03-1400","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-jcx5-2hxr-pwq4/GHSA-jcx5-2hxr-pwq4.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-58011","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58011.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0675.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0674","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0674.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58010","title":"Linux Kernel binfmt_flat 整数溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 binfmt_flat（平坦二进制格式加载器）中存在整数溢出漏洞，影响 32 位系统。在计算 `full_data` 大小时，`data_len + relocs * sizeof(unsigned long)` 的运算中，`relocs` 重定位计数未经过充分校验，导致整数溢出，进而可能造成内存分配错误或越界访问。本地攻击者可通过加载特制的平坦格式二进制文件触发此漏洞，导致系统拒绝服务（内核崩溃）。虽然大多数大小和计数被限制在 256MB 以内，但 `relocs` 字段的校验缺失使得 32 位系统上的计算仍可能出错。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等，影响 Linux 内核多个版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58010"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:26Z","remediation":"更新 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：5.4.291、5.10.235、5.15.179、6.1.129、6.6.78、6.12.14 或 6.13.3 及以上。Ubuntu 用户安装 USN-7540-1/USN-7511-1/USN-7640-1/USN-7510-1/USN-7653-1 更新；Debian 用户安装 DLA-4178-1/DLA-4102-1 更新。无法立即更新时，可通过禁用 binfmt_flat 模块（`chmod -x /usr/bin/flat`）临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0b6be54d7386b7addbf9e5947366f94aad046938","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/55cf2f4b945f6a6416cc2524ba740b83cc9af25a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6fb98e0576ea155267e206286413dcb3a3d55c12","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8e8cd712bb06a507b26efd2a56155076aa454345","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/95506c7f33452450346fbe2975c1359100f854ca","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a009378af674b808efcca1e2e67916e79ce866b3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bc8ca18b8ef4648532c001bd6c8151143b569275","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d17ca8f2dfcf423c439859995910a20e38b86f00","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58010.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58010.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58010.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58010","https://github.com/HerringLiu2333/Analysis-of-CWE/blob/cd8202c32037ed388ecd79e1fc81394f13c4d4a4/CVE-2024-58010/CVE-2024-58010.ql","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58010.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-58010-2025-11-03-1335","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-58010.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-58010.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-6hq3-frr2-vjp4/GHSA-6hq3-frr2-vjp4.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0674.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0673","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0673.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58007","title":"Linux Kernel Qualcomm SoC socinfo 越界读取漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Qualcomm socinfo 驱动中存在越界读取漏洞，源于对 SMEM 中 serial_num 字段的边界检查使用了 offsetof() 而非 offsetofend()，导致未能正确验证字段末尾是否在有效内存范围内。本地低权限攻击者可通过读取 sysfs 中的 serial_number 文件触发该漏洞，造成越界内存读取，泄露敏感内核内存数据，并可能导致系统崩溃。该漏洞影响使用 MSM8916 芯片组的 Qualcomm 设备，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。Linux 内核主线已提交修复补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58007"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:25Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至修复版本：5.4.291+、5.10.235+、5.15.179+、6.1.129+、6.6.78+、6.12.14+ 或 6.13.3+。Ubuntu 用户安装 USN-7540-1 更新（linux-image-5.4.0-1129-raspi），Debian 用户应用 DLA-4178/DLA-4102 安全更新。无法立即升级时，可通过内核 livepatch 或禁用 sysfs 中 serial_number 节点的读取权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0a92feddae0634a0b87c04b19d343f6af97af700","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/22cf4fae6660b6e1a583a41cbf84e3046ca9ccd0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2495c6598731b6d7f565140f2bd63ef4bc36ce7d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2d09d3c9afa2fc422ac3df7c9b8534f350ee19dd","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/407c928305c1a37232a63811c400ef616f85ccbc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/47470acd719d45c4c8c418c07962f74cc995652b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7445fa05317534bbd8b373c0eff8319187916030","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9c88b3a3fae4d60641c3a45be66269d00eff33cd","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58007.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58007.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58007.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58007","https://github.com/HerringLiu2333/Analysis-of-CWE/blob/cd8202c32037ed388ecd79e1fc81394f13c4d4a4/CVE-2024-58007/CVE-2024-58007.ql","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58007.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-58007-2025-11-03-1400","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/648427aa2db027c1629d5ac1fafa487d8d68e08f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-58007.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-58007.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-f23q-rhxc-p26p/GHSA-f23q-rhxc-p26p.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0673.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0672","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0672.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58006","title":"Linux kernel PCI dwc ep BAR 大小/标志变更检查缺失漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 PCI DWC 子系统中存在 BAR 配置验证缺失漏洞。pci_epc_set_bar() 函数在更新 BAR 的映射物理地址时，未充分校验新 BAR 的大小和标志位是否与已有配置一致。攻击者可在具备低权限的本地条件下，通过调用 set_bar() 设置与现有 BAR 配置不同的尺寸，导致 iATU 地址转换范围小于主机已确定的 BAR 大小。当主机读取超出新 BAR 范围的内存时，数据将绕过地址转换直接透传，可能读取到不属于当前 struct pci_epf_bar 的内核内存，造成敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响使用 DesignWare PCIe 控制器的 Linux 内核系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58006"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:25Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.12.14 及以上版本（或 6.13.3、6.14），包含提交 b5cacfd06706 的补丁。Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户可安装 linux-image-6.8.0-64-generic 版本（USN-7653-1）。如无法立即升级，可限制本地用户对 PCIe EP 功能驱动（drivers/pci/controller/dwc/pcie-designware-ep.c）的访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3229c15d6267de8e704b4085df8a82a5af2d63eb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3708acbd5f169ebafe1faa519cb28adc56295546","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b5cacfd067060c75088363ed3e19779078be2755","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58006.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58006.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58006","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2024-58006.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58006.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/648427aa2db027c1629d5ac1fafa487d8d68e08f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-58006.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-58006-pci-dwc-ep-prevent-changing-bar-siz-1767882978000.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-58006.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-wf3x-qxfc-v57v/GHSA-wf3x-qxfc-v57v.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-58006"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0672.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0670","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0670.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58002","title":"Linux Kernel uvcvideo 驱动释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 UVC 视频驱动（drivers/media/usb/uvc/uvc_v4l2.c）中存在释放后使用漏洞。当应用程序通过 V4L2 接口提交异步控制请求时，驱动会保存发起操作的文件句柄指针。若用户在设备操作完成前关闭该文件描述符，对应的内核结构体被释放，但驱动中仍保留指向已释放内存的悬空指针。后续设备完成异步操作时会访问该悬空指针，导致释放后使用。本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞触发内核内存破坏，实现权限提升，获得完全控制目标系统的能力。CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Linux 主线内核已合入修复补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58002"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:25Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至以下已修复版本：6.13.3 及以上、6.12.14 及以上、6.6.80 及以上。Debian 11 用户安装 DLA-4178 更新，Debian 12 用户安装 DSA-5900 更新，Ubuntu 18.04 LTS 用户安装 USN-7540-1 更新。如无法立即升级，可通过限制本地用户对 UVC 视频设备的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/117f7a2975baa4b7d702d3f4830d5a4ebd0c6d50","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/221cd51efe4565501a3dbf04cc011b537dcce7fb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2a29413ace64627e178fd422dd8a5d95219a2c0b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/438bda062b2c40ddd7df23b932e29ffe0a448cac","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4dbaa738c583a0e947803c69e8996e88cf98d971","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/653993f46861f2971e95e9a0e36a34b49dec542c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9edc7d25f7e49c33a1ce7a5ffadea2222065516c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ac18d781466252cd35a3e311e0a4b264260fd927","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00045.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58002.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58002.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58002.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58002","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58002.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-58002-2025-11-03-1335","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/648427aa2db027c1629d5ac1fafa487d8d68e08f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-58002.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-58002.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-qc22-v4cr-4rv7/GHSA-qc22-v4cr-4rv7.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-58002-media-uvcvideo-remove-dangling-poin-1771405881000.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0670.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0609","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0609.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57852","title":"Linux Kernel Qualcomm SCM 固件空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Qualcomm SCM（安全通道管理器）固件驱动中存在空指针解引用漏洞。由于 qcom_scm_get_tzmem_pool() 函数在 SCM 设备缺失时会返回 NULL，而调用者未正确检查返回值，导致在特定条件下对空指针进行解引用操作，引发内核崩溃。本地攻击者需具备低权限即可触发此漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 Qualcomm 芯片的 Linux 内核系统，已在 Linux 内核主线中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57852"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:06Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.12.16、6.13.4 或 6.14 及以上版本。对于无法升级内核的系统，可手动 cherry-pick 补丁提交 cd955b75849b、57a811c0886f 或 94f48ecf0a53 到对应内核分支，在 drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm-smc.c 中增加对 qcom_scm_get_tzmem_pool() 返回 NULL 的判空处理。临时缓解措施可禁用受影响设备上的 Qualcomm SCM 固件接口模块加载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/57a811c0886f3f3677bb4619502b35b5bb917f2e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/94f48ecf0a538019ca2025e0b0da391f8e7cc58c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cd955b75849b58b650ca3f87b83bd78cde1da8bc","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57852.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57852.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57852","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2024-57852.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57852.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57852.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57852-firmware-qcom-scm-smc-handle-missin-1771405501000.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57852.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-232p-m442-j9m4/GHSA-232p-m442-j9m4.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2024-57852"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0609.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0605","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0605.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57834","title":"Linux kernel vidtv 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 media 子系统的 vidtv（虚拟数字电视）驱动中存在空指针解引用漏洞。当 vidtv_start_streaming() 中 dvb->mux 未通过 vidtv_mux_init() 成功初始化时，后续调用 vidtv_mux_stop_thread() 会访问空指针 mux，导致内核崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可通过构造特殊 DVB 设备操作序列触发此漏洞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57834"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T03:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:05Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至包含 commit 9b2ffa6148b1 的版本（主线 v6.13-rc4 及以上）。Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户升级至 linux-image-5.15.0-1083-gcp 或更新版本（USN-7511-1）；Debian 11 用户应用 DLA-4178 安全更新。如无法立即升级，可卸载或禁用 vidtv 内核模块（modprobe -r vidtv），该模块仅用于测试目的，非生产环境必需。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1221989555db711578a327a9367f1be46500cb48","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2c5601b99d79d196fe4a37159e3dfb38e778ea18","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/52d3512f9a7a52ef92864679b1e8e8aa16202c6a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/59a707ad952eb2ea8d59457d662b6f4138f17b08","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/86307e443c5844f38e1b98e2c51a4195c55576cd","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/904a8323cc8afa7eb9ce3e67303a2b3f2f787306","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/95432a37778c9c5dd105b7b9f19e9695c9e166cf","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57834.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE